#	Input			: NA
#	Output			: NA
#	Called Script	:
#	Calling Script	: getcparamvalue.scr
#	Menu Option		: CATODAPP
#	Srl. No		Date			Author			Description.
#	-------		----			------			----------------
#	1.0			21-05-2013		Farhan	 		Original Version
#	2.0			28-05-2013		Saurabh Sinha	If Block is added
